TITLE Gas dissolution into Ca solution with mineral assemblage at 100C

SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        7 charge
    Ca        50 mmol/kgw

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite    0 10
    Gypsum     0 10
    Aragonite  0 10

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 25
    CO2(g)   1.0
    CH4(g)   5.0
    H2S(g)   10.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     gas_dissolve.out
    -reset    false
    -gas      CO2(g) CH4(g) H2S(g)

END
